le":false},"id":"hint-person-wrap","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"align":"end","text":{"$i18n":"comments.resolveNeedsPerson"},"tone":"muted","variant":"label","visible":false,"weight":"normal"},"id":"hint-person","type":"Text"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"direction":"horizontal","justify":"end","visible":false},"id":"hint-key-wrap","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"align":"end","text":{"$i18n":"access.requiresKey"},"tone":"muted","value":"reviews.resolve","variant":"label","visible":false,"weight":"normal"},"id":"hint-key","type":"Text"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"direction":"horizontal","justify":"end","visible":false},"id":"hint-unsupported-wrap","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"align":"end","text":{"$i18n":"commentBlock.unsupported"},"tone":"muted","variant":"label","visible":false,"weight":"normal"},"id":"hint-unsupported","type":"Text"}]},"type":"Stack"},{"config":{"direction":"horizontal","justify":"end","visible":false},"id":"reopen-only","slots":{"content":[{"config":{"icon":"rotate-ccw","label":{"$i18n":"thread.reopen"},"size":"sm","variant":"outline"},"id":"reopen-only-button","type":"Button"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Thread bubble","spec":{"accessibility":["The bubble is a dialog named by the Widget it is about; focus lands in the reply box and Escape returns it to the pin. Status is a glyph with its word, and the timeline is a list named \"Thread history\".","Resolve names what it does through the line under it (aria-describedby), and a refusal reason is text, never only a disabled button."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Button, Badge, Icon, Avatar, TextInput, Skeleton); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The status, the target and the timeline entries are shown or hidden by Variants. The menu, the reason step, the delete confirmation, the message editing and the notices of a changed thread are in the sibling Views; the bubble sits on a plain canvas surface here, not over a View, and its pointer is not modelled.","The strings of the app are copied under the same Locale keys; names and ids bind through value, value2 and a sentence the app builds from a translated word is one sample string per Locale. Buttons are 28px (the app's 24px buttons have no Kit size).","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (names, ids, change domains); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member pressed a pin or a Comments row of a View; the bubble opens at the pin, 320px wide, with focus in the reply box (or on the bubble when the member cannot reply).","The base state is an open thread on a Button of the Checkout View with a message and an Agent's answer, read by a member who may reply and resolve; Variants show the other statuses and the other kinds of viewer.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the bubble is Workbench chrome, so its text follows the Workbench language and is baked here per Locale. The names, messages, times and ids are sample content."],"intent":"Show the thread bubble of the Workbench canvas as built from Adapter Widgets only: what opens when a pin or a Comments row is pressed. The status, what the thread is about, the thread as one chronological timeline of messages and lifecycle events, the reply box and the one-click Resolve with the line that says what it does.","interactionRules":["The header names the status (open, ready for review, resolved or dismissed, a glyph with its word) and what the thread is about: the Widget type and id, or Whole View for a comment on the View as a whole. More opens the thread menu; Close closes the bubble.","Below the header, one timeline lists the messages with their author (an Agent is marked), the re-anchor events, the submissions with their change domains, Evidence count and id, and the lifecycle events: resolutions with their kind, and reopenings with their reason. Nothing is dropped when a thread is reopened.","A ready-for-review thread keeps its submission as Current; a thread closed with a resolution other than verified marks the submission it leaves pending as Not accepted.","Reply sends the typed message with ⌘↵; Resolve is one click: on an open thread it resolves as Answered, on a ready-for-review thread it accepts its submission as Verified and says which one. Reopen asks for an optional reason.","A resolved or dismissed thread has no reply box; it offers Reopen to a member who may. A member who cannot resolve sees why under the reply box, instead of a Resolve button; a member who cannot reply sees the timeline only."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"7f3d7780-3cb9-4e57-8f0b-2e8d569905c1"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"c6c0a101-7b3e-4d19-8a26-3e9d1c0b6a01"}],"requirements":["01a11544-53e8-75b3-b819-d86993a21069","01a11544-5702-78b6-95ea-c15fe80ad4e3"]},"variants":{"dismissed":{"requirements":["01a11544-5772-750b-9ab3-adcc04d755a9","01a11544-566b-7472-8e4d-b20f5e348222"],"state":{"ev-dismissed":{"visible":true},"ev-reanchored":{"visible":false},"ev-reopened":{"visible":false},"ev-submission":{"visible":true},"ev-submission-current":{"visible":false},"ev-submission-not-accepted":{"visible":true},"ev-verified":{"visible":false},"h-status-dismissed":{"visible":true},"h-status-open":{"visible":false},"h-status-ready":{"visible":false},"h-status-resolved":{"visible":false},"hint-accepts-wrap":{"visible":false},"hint-answered-wrap":{"visible":false},"hint-key-wrap":{"visible":false},"hint-person-wrap":{"visible":false},"hint-unsupported-wrap":{"visible":false},"life-row":{"visible":false},"m2":{"visible":false},"reopen-on